    `Actor`, so every constructor of `Actor` can reach this read.

    Write the group as one `CONSIDER`, which does narrow:

      CONSIDER s
      WHEN Tenant t THEN … s's monthly_rent …
      OTHERWISE …

    (or just `THEN t` when the field is the whole payload), or declare `monthly_rent` on
    `Landlord` or `Agent` too.

